// ModelDisplayName :
"P3427489650" "Scared recruit"
// Description :
"P3937915643" "hostages to rescue"
// SingularDescription :
"P4146576400" "Rescue the last hostage!"
// InteractBeginString :
"P856364347" ""
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1198641271" "They were going to change us!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostages 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3357212317" "I've had second thoughts. I don't want to be in the Council!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostages 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3380221718" "They're monsters! Do you know what they wanted to do to us?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostages 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3653791302" "It's recently dawned on me that ship building is a very noble occupation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostages 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3133338667" "They said they'd infuse me with a Nictus! What's a Nictus?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostages 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1773769891" "I am so outta here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1127821804" "You have rescued the hostages from Arakhn's troops."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1310520188" "So, Arakhn and the Council are using Nictus fragments to fashion their Galaxy troops. And when something goes wrong, however slight, the merger results not in a powerful soldier, but in a bestial war wolf! How disgusting! Listen, heroes. When I became fused with a Kheldian, it was with my full knowledge and consent. Indeed, that is the only way that such a permanent merger is possible, either for Kheldians or for Nictus. But it seems that the Council is able to force these mere fragments on their recruits. I cannot imagine anything more diabolical! Nor can I doubt that Arakhn is behind it all."
// RandomFameString :
"P2214137711" "{TaskForceName} saved my best friend from being turned into a war wolf!"

