// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P262443888" "If those men you saved are correct, there is still another prisoner in the Council's clutches. This Dr. Todd they spoke of must be rescued. I don't know whether Arakhn plans to infuse her with a Nictus fragment, as she tried to do to those recruits, or whether she has some darker purpose in mind. But I am certain her plot must be stopped. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go and interrogate Arakhn's soldiers, {TaskForceName}.</a> Perhaps one of them can tell us where Dr. Todd is imprisoned. <br><br>Take this emergency medical transporter in case you find her. She may have need of it. But {TaskForceName}, please don't let her get hurt. I'll consider this mission a failure if anything happens to her."
// AcceptString :
"P2010102774" "Interrogate Arakhn's soldiers"
// SendOffString :
"P3742762615" "I know Arakhn's cruelty, {TaskForceName}. I know what she is capable of."

