// Dialog :
"P3345887769" "You rescued Dr. Todd!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4045470374" "Dr. Todd was forced to teleport to safety."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3603460776" "The device Dr. Todd described is a thing most horrible, {TaskForceName}. I have told you that the Nictus once fed upon other Kheldians. What I did not tell you was how. The Nictus scientists developed a powerful energy transfer device that could rip away a Kheldian's life force, even at a distance of light years. This terrible weapon is the reason we Peacebringers have resolved to destroy all Nictus, wherever they may be. If Arakhn plans to recreate this device, she must be stopped! Immediately!"
// RandomFameString :
"P1763242454" "Did you hear that {TaskForceName} rescued the famous Dr. Todd? I just loved her recent paper, 'Kinetics and Catalysis!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3183852525" "Dr. Todd should recover any day. When I spoke with her, she described a great energy transfer device Arakhn forced him to develop. I believe I know what it is. <br><br>It is a thing most horrible, {TaskForceName}. I have told you that the Nictus once fed upon other Kheldians. What I did not tell you was how. The Nictus scientists developed a powerful energy transfer device that could rip away a Kheldian's life force, even at a distance of light years. This terrible weapon is the reason we Peacebringers have resolved to destroy all Nictus, wherever they may be. If Arakhn plans to recreate this device, she must be stopped! Immediately!"
// RandomFameString :
"P642503078" "My kinetics professor is still in the hospital."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P36814835" "If Arakhn truly intends to replicate the machine that allowed the Nictus to feast upon the Kheldians, it will be disastrous. There are hundreds of Kheldians living on this planet, and millions more in our home galaxy. In an eye blink she could murder us all! <br><br>Dr. Todd mentioned another facility where she was briefly imprisoned. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to go there and see what you can learn.</a> If you find anything of note, please take it to one of this world's wise women. Her name is Dr. Ann-Marie Engles."
// AcceptString :
"P2670627950" "Investigate the other facility"
// SendOffString :
"P1517243395" "It has been a long time since I have been this badly shaken, {TaskForceName}. Please, help me end this dreadful plot!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound6_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3562925072" "Defeat all villains in base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1253530683" "We still know little about Arakhn's plans."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2303167894" "You hear the hiss of perfectly tuned machinery."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Schematic 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P4105117061" "Computer"
// InteractBeginString :
"P1586292237" "You begin to hack the computer."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3404127526" "You have hacked the computer."
// InteractActionString :
"P2659525134" "Hacking..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1336662724" "You found a schematic."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2104834495" "You defeated the villains and found some schematics."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound6_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1590374125" "Take schematics to Dr. Engles"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P271679491" "Dr. Engles should see those schematics. She may be able to tell us what we're dealing with."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3341339907" "Get the plans!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2526237799" "Hmm. I'm afraid your friend, Moonfire, is mistaken. These schematics do not describe any machine that sucks energy. On the contrary. They describe a machine that transmits energy, directly into a human body. I think this machine is what allowed Arakhn to force those Nictus fragments on her recruits. What's worse, these plans describe how to make the machine stronger! <br><br>I believe this Arakhn plans to permanently merge living Nictus with hundreds of Paragon citizens. The machine would allow her to do this without the host's participation or consent. We would become creatures like her, twisted by evil, able only to serve as vessels for our Nictus masters."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P22097895" "So, Arakhn plans to plant the remaining Nictus within Paragon City's people? And she has found a way to make the merging permanent without their consent? Her evil can pain me, {TaskForceName} but it can surprise me no longer. She must be stopped. For the good of humanity, and that of the entire universe."
// RandomFameString :
"P2926441969" "I hear {TaskForceName}'s onto something major about that Arakhn woman."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2604308391" "I have a plan I would like to share with you, {TaskForceName}. It is a bold one. I intend to use Arakhn's plot against her, but it will require knowing the names of her intended victims. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Do you think you can get that information for me?</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P2866724310" "Locate the names of Arakhn's intended victims"
// SendOffString :
"P1460211497" "If we can figure out who Arakhn plans to infect with her Nictus invaders, we can get to them first, and lay a pretty trap! While you're there, it would behoove you to take out a few of her men. The more we can weaken her power, the better the next phase of the plan will go."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3019141129" "Defeat Archon Salvatore & his men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4064302030" "I need the names of Arakhn's intended victims if I am to pull off my plan!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3873167910" "Darkness seems to cloak this place."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P418595528" "Archon Salvatore"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

